y one mail  you get one free so we put those in the  freezer so we'd had a romantic meal I'd  light a candle we preheat the Italian  food put it on nice plates and then we'd  like move the table and we'd dance in  the kitchen and just reconnect remember  why you're doing it and then okay I can  do this for five years or I can do this  for however long it's gonna take cuz  then once you're finished your life is  just that weight is lifted off your  shoulders and you're free you're really  free  individually my turning point was when I  went to see Dave I think as a couple our  turning point was when we came out of  that attorney's office and we met at the  stairs and we just knew we got something  here and we don't want to let it go you  know God had a different plan for us  the debt-free  [Music]  you know we started out all this  chemistry came together in this marriage  in really walked away from God and you  know as a family and we got ourselves in  a gigantic pile of debt we nearly lost  everything you know another broken  marriage for both of us and a child that  you know wouldn't have both parents so  in five years we look back and we've  paid off over $300,000 in debt and now  in net worth at one point almost 1.3  million and saved the marriage which was  really the goal right bonus bonus from  God  [Music]  you

